            <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                    本作の最大の見どころは、シチュエーションが徐々にエスカレートしていく緊迫感と、女優が魅せる本気の快楽表情。一度火がついたら止まらない怒涛のピストンと、理性が崩壊した甘美な吐息に息を呑むこと間違いなしの傑作です。\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"pt-2\">\n                <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dembz00270&af_id=onchan555-007&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full py-3.5 px-6 rounded-xl font-black text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-rose-600 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-rose-500 shadow-lg shadow-amber-900/30 transition-all text-sm tracking-wide\">\n                  <span>FANZA公式で作品詳細・本編を見る</span>\n                  <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 ml-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"></path></svg>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"my-10 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-900/80 border border-neutral-800 shadow-xl\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 font-bold text-sm rounded-full border border-amber-500/30\">厳選第3位</span>\n            <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 font-mono tracking-wider\">IPZZ-751 (IPZZ-00751)</span>\n            <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">| 出演: 西宮ゆめ、miru</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4 leading-snug hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors\">\n            <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dipzz00751&af_id=onchan555-007&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">同窓会の夜、酔った勢いで懐かしの母校へ 俺のことをず